  "description": "Born with a rare constitution that produces breast milk even without pregnancy, Nan has spent her life running from those who seek to exploit her unique body. Desperate for money, she answers a job posting for a wet nurse at a wealthy household deep in the mountains and meets the adorable young boy named Sajun.Yet strange dreams begin to haunt her — a familiar man appears night after night, teasing her in increasingly intimate ways...\n\n\n\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/my_nanny)",
